   "updated": 1791884284389,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Surface fold\n每个节点只投影一次并缓存，结果深冻结\nreplace 节点遮蔽 startSeq..endSeq 区间\n跳过：turn/step、assistant/attempt、llm/retry、空内容 assistant\n节点 0 永远是当前系统提示词；in-history 路由上提示词变化只追加新 system 节点",
   "originalText": "Surface fold\n每个节点只投影一次并缓存，结果深冻结\nreplace 节点遮蔽 startSeq..endSeq 区间\n跳过：turn/step、assistant/attempt、llm/retry、空内容 assistant\n节点 0 永远是当前系统提示词；in-history 路由上提示词变化只追加新 system 节点",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rectangle-58",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
